block, which holds the five trait impl lines. It asserts that this set equals `RustdocSignatures::trait_impls` from rustdoc's trait-implementations section. Dropping `Copy` or `Serialize`, or adding an unlisted impl, fails the test.\n\nThe test therefore asserts every structural obligation in the text. I found no gap and no acknowledgments apply.",
